==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**24,600 grants +3 Ammonite Z.
**24,700 grants +5 Catamin [A].
**24,800 grants +5 Catamin [B].
*Added a 19th lineup that can be unlocked after obtaining 120 [[Meow Medals]].
*Added a prompt to use a Catamin [A] to restore a stage attempt directly after clearing a Gauntlet stage.
*Added the Energy Rush event (統率力リターン, ''Tōritsuryoku Ritān''). During this event, [[Cat Energy|energy]] spent on [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP Guerrilla Stages]] and [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed/Maniac Stages]] will only be consumed after a victory; energy will be refunded when losing or quitting, even after 10 seconds.
*[[Talent Orbs]] are now divided into 2 categories: '''Effect''' (効果, ''Kōka'') and '''Ability''' (能力, ''Nōryoku''). Effect Orbs are the pre-existing trait-specific Orbs, while Ability Orbs are 6 new Orb types that are not trait-specific and give units new abilities or situational buffs:
**'''Mini-Deathsurge''' (デス小烈波, ''Desu Shō Reppa''): Every 2nd unit deployed has a 100% chance to create a Lv.1 [[Mini-Surge]] that deals 3-20% damage at 200~500 upon death. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Resist Waves''' (波動ダメージ耐性, ''Hadō Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Wave Attack]]s by 5-50%. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Wave Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Waves Orb and a level 10 Resist Wave [[Talents|Talent]].
**'''Cash Back''' (キャッシュバック, ''Kyasshu Bakku''): Every 2nd unit deployed refunds 5-50% of their cost upon death. Becomes a full refund with two S-Rank Cash Back Orbs.
**'''Resist Knockback''' (ふっとばし耐性, ''Futtobashi Taisei''): Reduces the distance the unit is pushed back by Knockback effects by 5-50%. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Knockback Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Knockback Orb and a level 10 Resist Knockback Talent (A-Rank for [[Urashima Taro (Uber Rare Cat)|King Gamereon]] specifically).
**'''Boost Stories of Legend''' (レジェンドストーリー強化, ''Rejendo Sutōrī Kyōka''): Increases health and attack power by 5-50% in [[Stories of Legend]]. It has no effect in other stages such as [[Uncanny Legends]], [[Zero Legends]] or [[Event Stages]]. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Colossus Slayer''' (超生命体特効, ''Chō Seimeitai Tokkō''): Every 2nd unit deployed has 5-30% more health and 5-60% more damage against [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus Enemies]]. This does not stack with pre-existing Colossus Slayer abilities. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*All units with Ultra Talents now have 2 Talent Orb slots at level 60, including [[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Crystal Cat]], [[Megidora (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Megidora]], [[Raiden (Uber Rare Cat)|God-Emperor Raiden]], [[Mekako Saionji (Uber Rare Cat)|Mission Control Mekako]], [[Warlock and Pierre (Uber Rare Cat)|Mad Doctor Klay]], [[Thunder God Zeus (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Zeus]] and [[Sea Maiden Ruri (Uber Rare Cat)|Mer-Queen Ruri]], who originally only had 1 slot in spite of receiving Ultra Talents.
*Added Mysterious Bronze, Silver and Golden Treasure Chests from Extreme Ranking Dojo events that drop Ability Orbs. 30 [[Cat Food]] can be spent to re-draw a chest.
*Added Legendary Basket for the Premium Fair Event Gacha.
*Added Legendary Dumbbell for the Baki Hanma Collaboration Event Gacha.

